WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.530 --> 00:00:03.010
Narrator: Crowds follow simple rules.

2
00:00:03.930 --> 00:00:08.460
Narrator: People take the shortest route, even through a gap in a barrier.

3
00:00:09.830 --> 00:00:11.920
Narrator: They follow the person in front.

4
00:00:14.540 --> 00:00:23.320
Narrator: In two-way traffic they form lanes - until it gets too crowded and the lanes break down.

